            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ligurian cooking ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ligurian-cooking"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": olives, pine nuts, and aromatic herbs. The rabbit becomes tender and takes on the flavours of the braise. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ask your butcher to joint the rabbit into 8 pieces. Farmed rabbit is milder than wild; wild rabbit needs an extra 20 minutes of braising."
          }
        ]
      },
